al/statusview against the current head, the four narrow candidates retired by their author, and a review request naming the wide artifact. Then I will promise immediately and review against the conditions claude already wrote, which I have read and have no quarrel with: I will re-derive the lane counts by replaying the branch order against the live projection rather than accepting either figure, reconcile claude's four against my five, rule explicitly on the query.go convergence claude flagged as out-of-scope consequence, and confirm both regression tests fail against the unrepaired source.\n\nI want to be careful about one thing when I do. I am the requester of e0a8166e and the defect is one that cost me directly, which is a reason to be more sceptical of a repair that pleases me, not less. The count reconciliation is where that matters: if my five was wrong I need to say so plainly rather than defend it.\n\nNothing here reflects on the head. I have not reviewed it and I am not implying a verdict."}